{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：16:27 2026-10-20 HKT</p>\n<p>牛池灣彩雲邨白虹樓對開一段新清水灣道，今日（10月20日）下午3時許，落斜方向近巴士站位置，一部旅遊巴收掣不及，直撞前方一部290A九巴。警方消防接報後趕至救援，確定旅遊巴4人及九巴4人輕傷（10至67歲），據了解包括學童，全部被送往聯合醫院救治。目前意外原因仍在調查。</p>\n<img alt=\"旅遊巴上有兒童等候救援。FB：是日快快-巴士即日相\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2a15c0a268369baec42453cd976b267f/2026-10/856939490_1441702474757859_7029168433373219287_n_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"現場為牛池灣彩雲邨白虹樓對開一段新清水灣道。曾志恆攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/bb5b19d568996b6886953f203ae22c88/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-20_at_16_52_14.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"旅巴擋風玻璃碎裂甩脫。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/c957ab4272deed9305392def1f4cb239/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-20_at_16_52_14_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"旅巴車頭嚴重變形。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/9812105c64403daed4ce587d09cb64a6/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-20_at_16_52_14_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"現場遍地巴士殘骸，一片狼藉。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/3da57feb6ef31e5ee9d2f9d6f7ce56cb/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-20_at_16_52_15.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"現場遍地巴士殘骸，一片狼藉。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/8e8a62c4a13676655f715cea20aef5ff/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-20_at_16_52_16.jpeg\"/>\n<p>現場所見，旅遊巴上有學童等候救援，車頭變形凹陷，擋風玻璃碎裂甩脫，可謂一片狼藉。意外期間，新清水灣道往黃大仙方向近彩興里部份行車線封閉，交通繁忙。</p>\n<p>九巴回覆查詢時表示，下午近4時，一輛290A線駛至新清水灣道白虹樓時，被一輛載有學生的校巴從後撞及巴士車尾，巴士上4名乘客受傷。九巴已派員慰問傷者，會配合調查。</p>\n<img alt=\"警方仍在調查意外原因。曾志恆攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/6a3328b86359ae0be01a86aa15bd1994/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-20_at_16_52_20_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"九巴車長在場接受調查。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/df031c14c8834df0a97c7747272bbbdc/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-20_at_16_53_35.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"意外中傷者幸輕傷清醒，獲送院治理。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/7f8da9d56faf87b73700e03c549254fa/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-20_at_16_52_18.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"意外中傷者幸輕傷清醒，獲送院治理。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/6d623bad63229b4ef7bc764ffe1d288f/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-20_at_16_52_20.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"傷者包括兒童。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/ff98dcd9d710c42311e17ff3b5f3024c/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-20_at_16_52_19.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"傷者包括兒童。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/13a3ca65f0fc59e76cd16e893d68914e/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-20_at_17_07_42.jpeg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T12:41:05.616597+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":316,"images":12,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T09:34:21+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-20T21:18:14.710635+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T12:38:00.705809+00:00","content_hash":"78984715a7e3a5297e1be4f3d4dbc90e7d5f9f42dba2efee6d8d730f56e8bdce","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}